{"shortDescription":"Vancouver, British Columbia--(Newsfile Corp. - September 11, 2026) - Antimony Resources Corp. CSE:ATMY (OTCQB: ATMYF) (FSE: K8J0) (the \"Company\" or \"Antimony Resources\" or \"ATMY\") is pleased to announce that it has received assays from drill holes in the Main and Central Zones at the Bald Hill Anti…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Vancouver, British Columbia--(Newsfile Corp. - September 11, 2026) - Antimony Resources Corp. ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"CSE:ATMY","text":"CSE:ATMY"}}," (OTCQB: ATMYF) (FSE: K8J0) (the \"Company\" or \"Antimony Resources\" or \"ATMY\") is pleased to announce that it has received assays from drill holes in the Main and Central Zones at the Bald Hill Antimony Project in New Brunswick. The drill holes are part of the current drill program intended to expand the mineralization in the Main Zone and fill-in gaps in the data."]},{"type":"p","children":["Drill holes in the Central Zone are the first in this series yet to be reported."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Drill Results"]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Main Zone"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["Drilling continued in the Main Zone with drill holes BH-26-19 and BH-26-21 returning high-grade antimony values. We note the high-grade antimony in BH-26-21 with a grade of ",{"type":"b","children":["27.3 % Sb over 0.3 meters (m) within a zone of 2.28% Sb over a length of 9.12 m from 144.38 to 153.5 m depth"]},". ",{"type":"b","children":["The corresponding gold assay is 0.93 g/t over the same width with a high of 3.66 g/t."]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Table 1: Assay Results from Recently Completed Drill Holes BH-26-19, BH-26-21, in the Main Zone at Bald Hill."]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Drill Hole BH-26-19, Antimony (Sb) and Gold (Au)"]}]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"t